    sspec_simple_check_describe_it_parser_2026-06-28, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep-20261127: reproduced - bin/simple check on paren-form describe spec files (describe("..."):) fell through to raw parse/HIR error spam instead of the actionable E-SSPEC-CHECK message; space form worked. Root cause src/app/check/sspec_source.spl recognized only the describe-space form. Fix recognizes both describe-space and describe( top-level forms ending in ':' (text-only, no signature changes). Spec test/01_unit/app/check/check_sspec_guidance_shared_lexer_spec.spl extended with 3 examples (inline paren probe, corpus arm on coauthor_spec.spl, negative control without std.spec import): new examples 3/3 PASS; check on probe and coauthor_spec now emits E-SSPEC-CHECK. Neighbours core_source_facts 28/28, multiline_string 5/5 PASS. One pre-existing failure in the same spec file (corpus arm broken by committed @cover-header sweep 7855256b308) is unrelated and left for its owning lane. close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/app/check/check_sspec_guidance_shared_lexer_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/app/check/core_source_facts_spec.spl"

